Mathematics department, and are not the Physics department.\n```sql\nSELECT sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME, SUM(sad.CLEARING_COST_COLLECTOR) AS total_clearing_cost_collector FROM SIS_DEPARTMENT sd JOIN SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT sad ON sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE = sad.SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT_CODE WHERE sd.IS_DEGREE_GRANTING = 'Y' AND sd.DEPT_BUDGET_CODE > 100000 AND sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME <> 'Mathematics' AND sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE <> '8' GROUP BY sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME ;\n```\n3. For each department that is degree granting, has a department budget code greater than 100000, is not the Mathematics department, and is not the Physics department, give the department name and the total clearing cost collector, but only include those departments where the total clearing cost collector is greater than the average clearing cost collector across all such departments.\n```sql\nWITH inner_cte AS ( SELECT sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME, SUM(sad.CLEARING_COST_COLLECTOR) AS total_clearing_cost_collector FROM SIS_DEPARTMENT sd JOIN SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT sad ON sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE = sad.SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT_CODE WHERE sd.IS_DEGREE_GRANTING = 'Y' AND sd.DEPT_BUDGET_CODE > 100000 AND sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME <> 'Mathematics' AND sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE <> '8' GROUP BY sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME ) SELECT DEPARTMENT_NAME, total_clearing_cost_collector FROM inner_cte WHERE total_clearing_cost_collector > ( SELECT AVG(total_clearing_cost_collector) FROM inner_cte );\n```\n4. For each degree-granting department with a department budget code greater than 100000, excluding the Mathematics and Physics departments, provide the department name, the total clearing cost collector, and the department's school name.\n```sql\nWITH inner_cte AS ( SELECT sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME, SUM(sad.CLEARING_COST_COLLECTOR) AS total_clearing_cost_collector, sd.SCHOOL_NAME FROM SIS_DEPARTMENT sd JOIN SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT sad ON sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE = sad.SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT_CODE WHERE sd.IS_DEGREE_GRANTING = 'Y' AND sd.DEPT_BUDGET_CODE > 100000 AND sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME <> 'Mathematics' AND sd.DEPARTMENT_CODE <> '8' GROUP BY sd.DEPARTMENT_NAME, sd.SCHOOL_NAME ) SELECT ic.DEPARTMENT_NAME, ic.total_clearing_cost_collector, ic.SCHOOL_NAME FROM inner_cte ic;\n```\n\n## Question\nFor each degree-granting department with a department budget code greater than 100000, excluding the Mathematics and Physics departments, where the total clearing cost collector is greater than the average clearing cost collector across all such departments, provide the department name, the total clearing cost collector, and the department's school name. List the results ordered by department name and total clearing cost collector descending. Do not return any rounded answers."
